      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是城市！在众多“都市女孩”当中，\n她也是最闪亮亮的一位赛马娘哩……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ac42abf92166a5434e51c29cfa8081eb0d69a49e5737dc0252c8e8652056f6",
