      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像小栗跟稻荷都是因为很强，才成为了“明星”。\n城市也是……！我也想要像她们一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f82ab5ba9bf7abeff73e5088d88f986f5448a57a68058f6b9eaf54f71ff09c91",
